{"sha": "79c10a1d4dcaf7b75e218eb0eb940f1e9285b1c9b1f291d01563c24159b7d5ae", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:filters-transfer-functions} 章 --- 滤波器与传递函数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:1}", "$0.5 \\to \\qty{-6.0}{dB}$; $10 \\to \\qty{20}{dB}$; $1/\\sqrt2 \\to \\qty{-3.0}{dB}$;", "$100 \\to \\qty{40}{dB}$. $\\qty{-40}{dB} \\to 0.01$; $\\qty{+6}{dB} \\to 2.0$.", "级联：$-6 - 20 = \\qty{-26}{dB}$，比值为 $0.05$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:2}", "$f_c = 1/(2\\pi RC) = 1/(2\\pi \\times 10^4 \\times 1.6\\times10^{-8}) =", "\\qty{1.0}{kHz}$。增益 $-10\\log(1 + (f/f_c)^2)$：\\qty{100}{Hz}：", "\\qty{-0.04}{dB}; \\qty{1}{kHz}: \\qty{-3}{dB}; \\qty{10}{kHz}: \\qty{-20}{dB};", "\\qty{100}{kHz}: \\qty{-40}{dB}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:3}", "(a) 低通滤波器（$C$ 在 $f$ 较高时使输出短路）；(b) 高通滤波器（$C$", "在 $f$ 较低时断开）；(c) 二阶低通滤波器（$L$ 在 $f$ 较高时断开，", "$C$ 使其短路）；(d) 带通滤波器（$C$ 阻断 $f$ 较低的成分，$L$ 阻断 $f$ 较高的成分）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:4}", "$4E/n\\pi$：在 \\qty{1}{kHz} 时为 \\qty{6.37}{V}，在 \\qty{3}{kHz} 时为 \\qty{2.12}{V}，", "在 \\qty{5}{kHz} 时为 \\qty{1.27}{V}。方波在", "半周期平移下呈反对称（$s(t + T/2) = -s(t)$），而偶次谐波", "则不具有此性质。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:5}", "在 \\qty{100}{Hz} 及其有用谐波处，$\\omega \\ll \\omega_c$：", "$\\underline H \\approx j\\omega/\\omega_c$，即导数除以", "$\\omega_c$。三角波的斜率为 $\\pm 4Ef = \\pm\\qty{400}{V/s}$，故", "输出为方波，其振幅为 $400/(2\\pi \\times 10^4) =", "\\qty{6.4}{mV}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:6}", "$\\omega \\gg \\omega_c$: $u_s \\approx (1/\\tau)\\int u_e\\,\\dd t$, $\\tau =", "1/(2\\pi \\times 10) = \\qty{16}{ms}$。$\\pm E$ 的积分是一个", "三角波，每半周期上升 $ET/2$，摆幅为 $ET/2\\tau$，振幅", "为 $ET/4\\tau = 1.0 \\times 10^{-3}/(4 \\times 0.016) = \\qty{16}{mV}$，围绕", "零值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:7}", "$f_0 = \\qty{5.03}{kHz}$. $Q = \\sqrt{L/C}/R = 1/\\sqrt2$: $R = \\sqrt2 \\times", "316 = \\qty{447}{\\ohm}$。在 $f_0$ 处：\\qty{-3}{dB}；在 $10f_0$ 处：$1/\\sqrt{1 +", "10^4} \\to \\qty{-40}{dB}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:8}", "$G = 1/\\sqrt{1 + Q^2(x - 1/x)^2}$，其中 $x = f/3$；在 \\qty{1}{kHz} 处：$x = 1/3$，", "$Q(x - 1/x) = -53$, $G = 0.019$; \\qty{3}{kHz}: $G = 1$; \\qty{5}{kHz}:", "$x = 5/3$，$21$，$G = 0.047$。输出在 \\qty{3}{kHz} 处为 \\qty{2.1}{V}，其中", "在 \\qty{1}{kHz} 处为 \\qty{0.12}{V}，在 \\qty{5}{kHz} 处为 \\qty{0.06}{V} --- 基本上", "是一个近似纯的 \\qty{3}{kHz} 正弦波。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:9}", "节点法：令 $a = jRC\\omega$，第一个电容器在上游看到 $R$，", "在下游看到 $R + 1/jC\\omega$，于是 $\\underline H = 1/(1 + 3a + a^2)$，即\\", "$1/[1 - (\\omega/\\omega_c)^2 + 3j\\omega/\\omega_c]$。在 $\\omega_c$ 处：$1/3j$，", "$G = 1/3$，\\qty{-9.5}{dB}；两个独立增益之积应为", "$1/2$, \\qty{-6}{dB}. $f_c = \\qty{1.0}{kHz}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:10}", "低于 $\\omega_1$ 时为 \\qty{0}{dB}；介于 $\\omega_1$ 与 $\\omega_2$ 之间时，增益", "按 \\qty{20}{dB/decade} 上升；高于 $\\omega_2$ 时保持平坦，为 $20\\log(\\omega_2/\\omega_1) =", "\\qty{40}{dB}$。相位为 $\\arctan(\\omega/\\omega_1) - \\arctan(\\omega/\\omega_2)$：", "在 $\\omega = 10^3$ 处，$\\arctan 10 - \\arctan 0.1 = 84^\\circ - 6^\\circ =", "78^\\circ$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:11}", "远高于截止频率时，$G \\approx f_c/f$；滤波后的纹波比", "为", "\\[", "\\frac{(4E/3\\pi)(f_c/100)}{2E/\\pi} = \\frac{2}{3}\\,\\frac{f_c}{100} < 0.01,", "\\]", "因此 $f_c < \\qty{1.5}{Hz}$，且 $\\tau = 1/2\\pi f_c > \\qty{0.1}{s}$。负载本身即为", "$R$：并联在其两端的电容不会造成电压降与功率损耗，", "而串联电阻则两者都会被白白消耗。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:filters-transfer-functions:12}", "$f_c = 1/(2\\pi RC) = 1/(2\\pi \\times 1.6\\times10^5 \\times 10^{-7}) =", "\\qty{10}{Hz}$，$\\tau = RC = \\qty{16}{ms}$。平顶段内", "电容器通过 $R$ 放电：输出按 $\\eu^{-t/\\tau}$ 衰减，", "自每个边沿起。半周期 $T/2$ 内的跌落为 $1 - \\eu^{-T/2\\tau}$：\\qty{50}{Hz}", "($T/2 = \\qty{10}{ms}$): $1 - \\eu^{-0.63} = 47\\%$; \\qty{1}{kHz}", "($T/2 = \\qty{0.5}{ms}$): $3\\%$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:filters-transfer-functions:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\underline H = \\underline U_{\\text{驱动}}/\\underline U_e$；", "$G_{\\mathrm{dB}} = 20\\log\\abs{\\underline H}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\underline H_L = R/(R + jL\\omega) = 1/(1 + j\\omega/\\omega_c)$,", "$\\omega_c = R/L$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $L = R/\\omega_c = 8.0/(2\\pi \\times 2000) = \\qty{0.64}{mH}$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\underline H_H = R/(R + 1/jC\\omega) = jRC\\omega/(1 + jRC\\omega)$,", "$\\omega_c = 1/RC$; $C = 1/(R\\omega_c) = \\qty{9.9}{\\micro F} \\approx", "\\qty{10}{\\micro F}$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} 在 $f_c$ 处各为 \\qty{-3}{dB}。\\qty{200}{Hz}（$x = 0.1$）时：低音扬声器", "\\qty{-0.04}{dB}，高音扬声器 \\qty{-20}{dB}。\\qty{20}{kHz}（$x = 10$）时：低音扬声器", "\\qty{-20}{dB}，高音扬声器 \\qty{-0.04}{dB}。", ""]}